+/*
+ * IMAGE 227: brute-force the gpu_cc_gx_gmu_clk gate directly. DIAGNOSTIC ONLY
+ * -- bypasses clk refcounting and is not a fix. Default off; enable with
+ * a6xx.force_gx_clk=1 on the cmdline.
