+		 * a block that is off while CP is on. RBBM_CLOCK_CNTL=0x8aa8aa02
+		 * is the only one ever logged, and it is an aggregate mask --
+		 * it says nothing about the CLOCK_CNTL2 per-block registers for
+		 * RB, SP, UCHE or TP, the GMU
