+	 * Samsung's downstream sets the extra 0x200 (disable_tseskip), giving
+	 * 0x00200200 -- the same value upstream uses for a640.
+	 *
+	 * Our tree writes the GENERIC value, (0x300 << 11) = 0x00180000, for
