+	 * pointer (8). The kernel clk_bulk_*() helpers index this array with
+	 * 16-byte stride, so the pointer size under-allocates: for the 5 GMU
+	 * clocks that is 40 bytes allocated but 80 written, corrupting the
+	 * adjacent slab objects. Same typo exists in upstream v4.19.
